; mini-analyze's reports, of the facts and the rules' answers: a C
; program's (C_report, with the facts given to Datalog), an ML program's
; (Ml_report), -dead's, -caps' (of both front ends' tables), and
; -fingerprint's (Answers, and natively Fingerprint: the .NET road's is a
; C module, ../dotnet/fingerprint.c). Both roads use them, the native
; mini-analyze and the .NET one (../dotnet). c/'s wrapped units opened,
; apart from ml/'s Ml_front (mini-ml's Parser, not mini-cc's)
(library
 (name ix_analyze_reports)
 (wrapped false)
 (flags (:standard -open Ix_analyze_c))
 (libraries ix_analyze_c ix_analyze_ml ix_datalog ix_prolog ix_core fpath caps))
